    "en": "Linear & nonlinear solvers"
  },
  "summary": {
    "ja": "全再直交化のLanczos最小二乗で代数鞍点系を解き、GMRESと同じ元残差および理想Schurの三点スペクトルを検査します。",
    "en": "Stored-basis, fully reorthogonalized Lanczos least squares solves algebraic saddle controls, checking the original residual against GMRES and the ideal-Schur spectrum."
  },
  "status": "educational-example",
  "origin": "development-candidate",
  "reading": {
    "ja": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/ja/read/validation-linear-algebra-spectral/",
