      "label": "Paige and Saunders: MINRES author documentation",
      "scope": "Selected author discussion of symmetry, indefinite A, SPD preconditioning, Lanczos and the original residual was read. The original 1975 paper was not read."
    }
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "Real symmetric nonsingular A, with SPD congruence preconditioning."
  ],
  "units": "Dimensionless algebraic controls. The FEM string has unit length, tension and density.",
  "boundary_conditions": "No physical boundary conditions apply to the algebraic matrices. The string has homogeneous Dirichlet endpoints.",
  "limitations": {
